    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mini 2D puzzle platformer procuded by Ninja Ming's team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players may Flash to resolve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;&gt; How to win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the goal, and touch the flag to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/40322e6efe3f83ff1e104138eeb4bbeb.poster.avif?t=1734451606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/40322e6efe3f83ff1e104138eeb4bbeb.webm?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/40322e6efe3f83ff1e104138eeb4bbeb.mp4?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;&gt; Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Flash-Skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot a bullet, then flash there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/41e6be58ea853a4e514a3e0330f05900.poster.avif?t=1734451606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/41e6be58ea853a4e514a3e0330f05900.webm?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/41e6be58ea853a4e514a3e0330f05900.mp4?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Ex-Flash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot second bullet, then flash there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/e5ff3c9ea607e3ec962000b213211bc6.poster.avif?t=1734451606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/e5ff3c9ea607e3ec962000b213211bc6.webm?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/e5ff3c9ea607e3ec962000b213211bc6.mp4?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;&gt; Content</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 1.5 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ levels</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mini 2D puzzle platformer procuded by Ninja Ming's team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players may Flash to resolve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;&gt; How to win?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the goal, and touch the flag to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/40322e6efe3f83ff1e104138eeb4bbeb.poster.avif?t=1734451606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/40322e6efe3f83ff1e104138eeb4bbeb.webm?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/40322e6efe3f83ff1e104138eeb4bbeb.mp4?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;&gt; Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Flash-Skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot a bullet, then flash there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/41e6be58ea853a4e514a3e0330f05900.poster.avif?t=1734451606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/41e6be58ea853a4e514a3e0330f05900.webm?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/41e6be58ea853a4e514a3e0330f05900.mp4?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Ex-Flash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot second bullet, then flash there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/e5ff3c9ea607e3ec962000b213211bc6.poster.avif?t=1734451606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/e5ff3c9ea607e3ec962000b213211bc6.webm?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569750/extras/e5ff3c9ea607e3ec962000b213211bc6.mp4?t=1734451606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt;&gt; Content</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About 1.5 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">60+ levels</p></li></ul>",
